The job is sent to the printer and starts fine, if the printer jams or
needs paper, an operator will address the problem, put the printer back
online and the job continues for a bit or may even finish but then the
same job starts to reprint from the beginning. This application has been
running on a Alpha4100/Tru64 4.0D system and the same printer for 2
years. We switched the application to an ES45/Tru64 5.1B last week. The
   printing was tested but with perhaps smaller print jobs. The queue is
defined the same and nothing has changed with the printer. I have since
tried to change some settings in the printer (jam recovery >auto>on>off,
