Hi managers

This morning I ran Sophos Sweep for Tru64 for the first time.  It swept.  I 
had no viruses, which was reassuring.  However, I appear to have been left 
with an odd effect on the date/time stamp of files.

As myself:

# ls -lt
total 14
-rw-------   1 gath01d  users       3055 Apr 15 09:28 aaconvert.pl
-rw-------   1 gath01d  users       8407 Apr 15 09:28 any-screener.pl
-rw-------   1 gath01d  users        493 Apr 15 09:28 out
-rw-------   1 gath01d  users        493 Apr 15 09:28 testprot1.fa
lrwxrwxrwx   1 gath01d  users         10 Jan 13 16:14 swiss@ -> /yd1/swiss

All files have redated to the time I ran the anti-virus scan, soft links 
however retain their original date (links aren't scanned).

but then.....

su

# ls -lt
total 14
lrwxrwxrwx   1 gath01d  users         10 Jan 13 16:14 swiss@ -> /yd1/swiss
-rw-------   1 gath01d  users        493 Dec 23  2003 out
