-rw-------   1 gath01d  users       3055 Nov 22  2003 aaconvert.pl
-rw-------   1 gath01d  users       8407 Nov 20  2003 any-screener.pl

as root the correct dates are restored.  Why have they been reset for 
ordinary users?  and how can I restore them so that ordinary users see the 
correct dates like root?

