Hi Managers,

A little while ago I posted the following query, regarding getting the 
power supply status of a DS25 running 5.1B.

I had a variety of responses the most useful from Martin Roende Andersen 
which advised to use the web interface of Insight Manager 
(http://localhost:2301) to check things out.

However it would appear that in this case for whatever reason, the box 
was misreporting. During some other maintenance work I had chance to do a 
show power at the SRM which showed that one of the Power Supplies was 
faulty, even though Insight Manager, and presumably the underlying SNMP 
traps, were showing that the power system was OK and fault tolerant...

Hopefully when I get the replacement PSU from HP, I'll have chance to 
figure out whats going on.

Cheers,

Rob


